<!-- Waterfront report: convoys hire guns, flotilla moves to Sri Lanka -->
<ScrollViewer xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
  xmlns:local="clr-namespace:SeapowerUI">

	<Border HorizontalAlignment="Center" VerticalAlignment="Center" Width="900" TextElement.FontFamily="Courier New" TextElement.Foreground="Black" TextElement.FontSize="16" Padding="45">
		<Border.Effect>
			<DropShadowEffect />
		</Border.Effect>
		<Border.Background>
			<ImageBrush ImageSource="{Binding Assets[bkg_paper]}" Stretch="UniformToFill"/>
		</Border.Background>
		
        <StackPanel Orientation="Vertical">

		<Grid
		  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
		  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml" >
		<Grid.RowDefinitions>
			<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
		</Grid.RowDefinitions>
			<Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
				<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
				<ColumnDefinition Width="3*"/>
				<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
			</Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
			
			<TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="0" Text="WORD ON THE" Margin="0" FontFamily="Arial Narrow Bold" FontSize="26" FontWeight="Bold" TextAlignment="Left"/>
			<TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="1" Text="******* WATERFRONT *******" Margin="40,0,40,0" FontWeight="Bold" TextAlignment="Center"/>
			<TextBlock Grid.Row="0" Grid.Column="2" Text="WATERFRONT" Margin="0" FontFamily="Arial Narrow Bold" FontSize="26" FontWeight="Bold" TextAlignment="Right"/>
			
		</Grid>
		
		<Rectangle HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Height="1" Fill="Black" Margin="0,0,0,1"/>
		<Rectangle HorizontalAlignment="Stretch" Height="1" Fill="Black" Margin="0,0,0,10"/>

			<Grid
			  xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
			  xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">
			<Grid.RowDefinitions>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="10"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
					<RowDefinition Height="Auto"/>
				</Grid.RowDefinitions>
				<Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="10"/>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="*"/>
					<ColumnDefinition Width="Auto"/>
				</Grid.ColumnDefinitions>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" HorizontalAlignment="Left" FontSize="16">
					FLASH<LineBreak/>
					Z 091430Z JUL 85
				</TextBlock>

				<TextBlock Grid.Row="1" Grid.Column="3" FontSize="16" Text="ZYUW RUEKJCS4169 1901430"/>
				
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="FM"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="3" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="FREE SEAS SYNDICATE"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="TO"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="4" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="RANSOM FLOTILLA"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="11" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="INFO"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="11" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="ALL CREWS"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="14" Grid.Column="0" FontSize="16" Text="SUBJ"/>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="14" Grid.Column="2" FontSize="16" Text="WATERFRONT REPORT 02 - THEY HIRED GUNS"/>

				<TextBlock Grid.Row="15" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" FontSize="16" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					<LineBreak/>
					BT
					<LineBreak/>
					<LineBreak/>
					1. The shippers learned. Convoys off the Horn now sail with escorts, and the hunting there gets thin. So we move east, where the money goes: the Dondra Head lane south of Sri Lanka, where every hull between the Gulf and Asia must pass.
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="16" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" FontSize="16" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					2. Expect a Knox frigate riding shotgun with Sea Sparrow and a helicopter, and an Indian Blackwood working the lane behind. The Knox kills gunboats. Bring missile boats or bring patience.
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="18" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="20,0,0,0">	
					- Knox first, merchants second, Blackwood whenever convenient. That is the order.
					<LineBreak/>
					- Sea Sparrow eats careless missiles. Shoot from range, shoot twice, turn away.
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>	
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="21" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					3. The lane is rich enough to feed us all winter. Make them pay for the escort and then take the ships anyway.
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
				<TextBlock Grid.Row="25" Grid.ColumnSpan="4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
					SIGNED: THE SYNDICATE
					<LineBreak/>
					<LineBreak/>
					BT
					<LineBreak/>
				</TextBlock>
			</Grid>
        </StackPanel>
    </Border>
</ScrollViewer>
